  "answer_text": "The fix is to move `bpf_copy_from_user` outside the preempt-disabled region. `bpf_copy_from_user` is a sleepable helper and cannot be called while preemption is disabled.\n\n```c\nSEC(\"?fentry.s/sys_getpgid\")\nint entry(void *ctx)\n{\n\tu32 data;\n\n\tbpf_copy_from_user(&data, sizeof(data), NULL);\n\tbpf_preempt_disable();\n\tbpf_preempt_enable();\n\treturn 0;\n}\n```",
